{"id":"175625664dfe6894","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md","title":"Bilinear Map","display":"df-bilinear-map — Bilinear Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bilinear-map","aliases":["58-df-bilinear-map","Bilinear Map"],"display":"df-bilinear-map — Bilinear Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-bilinear]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bilinear-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bilinear-map</span><span>Bilinear Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bilinear-map — Bilinear Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05b5dba2baae641d\" href=\"?note=05b5dba2baae641d\" title=\"58-df-bilinear\">58-df-bilinear</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,B,V,W,U\\in V\">\\(k,B,V,W,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)\\)</span> (bilinear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05b5dba2baae641d\" href=\"?note=05b5dba2baae641d\" title=\"58-df-bilinear\">58-df-bilinear</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bilinear}_k(B;V,W,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bilinear}_k(B;V,W,U)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{Bilinear}_k(B;V,W,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bilinear\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{Bilinear}_k(B;V,W,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bilinear: linear in each argument separately, not jointly</li>\n<li>This atom is an exact notational alias; the carrier and operation data are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"05b5dba2baae641d\" href=\"?note=05b5dba2baae641d\" title=\"58-df-bilinear\">58-df-bilinear</a>.</li>\n<li>Examples: inner product <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,v) \\mapsto \\langle u,v\\rangle\">\\((u,v) \\mapsto \\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span>, multiplication map</li>\n<li>Multilinear: bilinear with more variables; universal object is tensor product</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n<li>Abe and Hulanicki, Tensors and Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bilinear","status":"resolved","id":"05b5dba2baae641d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bilinear]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bilinear","status":"resolved","id":"05b5dba2baae641d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)$ (bilinear-map predicate, see [[58-df-bilinear]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bilinear","status":"resolved","id":"05b5dba2baae641d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This atom is an exact notational alias; the carrier and operation data are supplied by [[58-df-bilinear]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,B,V,W,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bilinear}_k(B,V,W,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bilinear}_k